\label{def:predictive-witness}
A predictive witness at interface $i$ is a pair of histories $h,h'\in\Histories_i$ such that
\begin{equation}
h \CurrentEquiv_i h'
\qquad\text{and}\qquad
\neg\bigl(h \FutureEquiv_i h'\bigr).
\label{eq:predictive-witness}
\end{equation}

